    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63746" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογο-ειδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prose-like, prosaic</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίχος</span> Sch.Heph.<i><span class="en">
				p.292
			</span></i> C., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				718.25
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ λ.</span>
			<i>prose</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				7.60
			</span></i>; but also, <i>command of language</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				1.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>resembling reason</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηρία λογοειδῆ, λογοειδεῖς ἐνέργειαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>reasonable, rational</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>in Alc.</u>
				p.68
			</span></i> C.</div>
